{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792612149,"nonce":"mgtXua3UNCJTI0wIjB/bEOBOJas=","title":"Align editor HXML dependency paths with native builds","message":"scripts/deps.sh passes local ashui component/icon/canvas/media, hlwgpu, hlwindow, ash-future and ash-simd source directories to Haxe. build.hxml omits most of these paths, so the language server sees an incomplete project. In particular ashui.core.render.UiFramework.register cannot resolve hlwgpu.hxsl.Extensions, and neither hlwgpu nor hlwindow is installed in the configured haxelib repository.\n\nDeclare the same local source paths in build.hxml. This changes project configuration rather than introducing special library names into the language server. Native LSP reproduction confirms that the initialization failure disappears with the existing binary after these paths are supplied.","files":null}]}